      "yanked": false,
      "notes": "AgentRT v0.1.15\n\n## 2. 平台支持\n\n- Linux（主力平台）：x86-64 / x86-32 / arm-64 / arm-32\n- macOS：arm-64（Apple Silicon）/ x86-64（Intel）\n- Windows：x86-64 / x86-32\n\n## 3. 安装\n\n```bash\ncurl -fsSL https://atomgit.com/openairymax/agentrt/releases/download/v0.1.15/install.sh | bash\n```\n\nWindows（PowerShell）：\n```powershell\nirm https://atomgit.com/openairymax/agentrt/releases/download/v0.1.15/install.ps1 | iex\n```\n\n## 4. 本版变更\n\n* agentrt: bump atoms and heapstore for Windows release fixes\n* atoms: bump for the shim_sync MSVC fix\n* deps: bump submodule gitlinks for 8.3.3-8.4.4 stage 3/4 work\n* daemons: bump for L2 envelope bridge (8.3.2)\n* commons: bump for duplicate macro guard and warning fixes\n* atoms: bump to a91df10 for corekern ipc reply routing fix\n* daemons: bump for L1 corekern server mount (8.3.1)\n* atoms: bump for corekern binder close-order UAF fix\n* atoms: bump to ring-buffer ipc channel (d0bcce6)\n* atoms/daemons: pick up leak fix and test isolation\n* deps: bump atoms and commons for 8.2.3 clock delegation\n* deps: bump submodule gitlinks for WS-8 ops-table and dedup work\n* agentrt: bump atoms for corekern dual-mode sync abstraction\n* agentrt: bump atoms for corekern freestanding shim\n* agentrt: bump atoms for corekern commons unlink\n* agentrt: bump atoms for corekern include decoupling\n* agentrt: bump atoms and heapstore for WS-5 test fixes\n* agentrt: bump gateway for k8s GATEWAY_API_KEY manifest wiring\n* atoms: bump corekern README two-stage truthfulness\n* agentrt: bump atoms for coreloopthree task_pending wake sender\n* commons: bump gitlink for zero-size allocation leak fix\n* agentrt: bump atoms and gateway for safe-memory fixes\n* commons: bump gitlink for IPC phase-1 defect fixes\n* submodules: bump daemons and heapstore for sandbox and store fixes\n* submodules: pull in gateway entry auth and bind hardening",
